# stage priority reason
# Read only when EDGEVISOR_SHADOW_ALLOCATION=file.
# priority and reversed run a short sustained profile and do not open this file.
# equal:    every stage the same weight.
# device_only:     sustained window. Device weight only, from 2000
#                  (measured, no sign) to 4000 (strong sign). An unread
#                  device stays 3000. Link scores are recorded and not used.
# device_link_max: same measurement, then max(device weight, that hop's
#                  link weight). This is an untested hypothesis.
# priority:        alias of device_link_max.
# mismatch:        same device weights, with the lowest and highest labels
#                  exchanged. Identical weights are not a mismatch control.
# reversed:        alias of mismatch. It does not replace risk with 1-risk.
# file:            read this file. This file still uses low=2 mid=3 high=4.
# EDGEVISOR_SHADOW_BUDGET_CAP, when set, limits each stage's shadow budget
# without changing the measured memory spare.
0 low dedicated-and-plugged-in
1 high mobile-unplugged
2 mid shared-workstation
3 low dedicated-and-plugged-in
